{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Practical, private therapy</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Confidential clinical therapy in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} — thoughtful support for specific challenges and steady planning toward meaningful shifts." />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body class="split-diagonal">
  <svg class="pattern-vis" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><use href="assets/img/pattern.svg#pattern"/></svg>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href="/">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <nav class="nav" aria-label="Primary Navigation">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/about.html">Practice</a></li>
          <li><a href="/approach.html">Methods</a></li>
          <li><a href="/specialties.html">Focus Areas</a></li>
          <li><a href="/fees.html">Investment</a></li>
          <li><a href="/faq.html">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="/book.html">Plan a Session</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
      <a class="cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero reveal-from-left" id="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1 class="hero-title">Intentional therapy for the day-to-day and the turning points</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Clinical support that helps you clarify steps, set manageable goals, and preserve privacy as you work through what matters.</p>
        <p class="hero-meta">Telehealth &amp; in-person in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • Confidential clinical care</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="muted" href="/about.html">Learn about the practice</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="what-to-expect reveal-from-right" id="what-to-expect">
      <div class="wrap grid">
        <div class="col">
          <h2>How sessions move forward</h2>
          <p>Each session centers your concerns with clear, practical steps. We collaboratively track progress, and I offer evidence-informed approaches while honoring your priorities. Sessions are confidential and tailored to your pace.</p>

          <ul class="bullets">
            <li>Focused agenda-setting each visit</li>
            <li>Tools you can use between sessions</li>
            <li>Options for short, focused intensives or weekly support</li>
          </ul>

          <p class="confidential">Confidentiality: Clinical notes are maintained in a secure record. I will discuss limits of confidentiality, mandated reporting, and how I handle records during intake.</p>

          <p class="scope">Scope &amp; boundaries: I provide psychotherapy for adults. I do not provide emergency services. If you are in crisis or at risk of harm, please contact local emergency services or a crisis line immediately.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="col session-planner" aria-labelledby="planner-heading">
          <h3 id="planner-heading">Session Planner</h3>
          <p>Build a short plan for what you'd like to focus on in early sessions. Use this as a guide to share at intake or keep for yourself.</p>

          <form id="planner-form">
            <label>Primary concern<textarea id="concern" rows="2" placeholder="A few words about what's brought you here"></textarea></label>
            <label>Top goals<textarea id="goals" rows="2" placeholder="A couple of things you'd like to see change"></textarea></label>
            <label>Session length<select id="length"><option value="45">45 minutes</option><option value="60">60 minutes</option></select></label>
            <label>Suggested rhythm<select id="rhythm"><option value="weekly">Weekly</option><option value="biweekly">Every other week</option><option value="short_intensive">Short intensive (3-4 sessions)</option></select></label>

            <div class="planner-outputs">
              <button type="button" id="build-plan">Create plan summary</button>
              <button type="button" id="copy-plan" disabled>Copy summary</button>
            </div>

            <pre id="plan-output" aria-live="polite" class="plan-output" tabindex="0">Your personalized plan will appear here.</pre>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="gallery reveal-from-bottom" id="gallery">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Common focuses</h2>
        <p>People work together here on transitions, boundaries, grief, relationship patterns, and workplace stress. Sessions are aimed at clarity, actionable steps, and preserving safety and confidentiality.</p>
        <div class="tiles">
          <div class="tile">Transitions &amp; life changes</div>
          <div class="tile">Navigating relationships</div>
          <div class="tile">Stress &amp; burnout strategies</div>
          <div class="tile">Coaching-style brief work</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="objections reveal-from-left" id="objections">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Practical questions</h2>
        <dl>
          <dt>What if I'm unsure therapy will help?</dt>
          <dd>We begin with an assessment of concerns and values. If a particular approach doesn't fit your needs, we'll discuss alternatives or referrals. There are no guarantees; therapy is a collaborative exploration.</dd>

          <dt>How is privacy handled?</dt>
          <dd>Sessions are private within the bounds of confidentiality. I keep secure records and will explain legal limits to confidentiality during intake.</dd>

          <dt>What about emergencies?</dt>
          <dd>I do not provide crisis services. If you are actively at risk, call local emergency services or a trained crisis line immediately.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band reveal-from-right" id="cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to begin a focused plan?</h2>
        <p>When you're prepared, reach out to set a first meeting. We'll review fit, confidentiality, and next steps together.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="muted" href="/contact.html">Contact &amp; insurance info</a>
        </div>
        <p class="contact-small">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="wrap">
      <small>&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Licensed clinician. All clinical contact is confidential except as required by law.</small>
      <nav aria-label="Footer">
        <ul>
          <li><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a></li>
          <li><a href="/fees.html">Fees</a></li>
          <li><a href="/contact.html">Contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
